me stuff and  they've not been banned arguably because  they're completely under the radar and  that's the concern I have none of these  companies did anything illegal and all  of these companies are more than  entitled more than entitled to have  Terms of Service and to enforce them if  you don't believe that then you have to  establish legally that they should be  regulated in terms of speech the way the  government is regulated I don't think  that's the solution send me your  thoughts if you disagree we have a  fantastic bonus show today we will talk  about the economy we will talk about  Pluto we will also talk about the most  and least valuable college degrees all  of that and more on today's bonus show  look forward to speaking to you back  the david pakman show at david  pakman.com  [Music]  you
 

